RES osdtriplet
! WAV: RMS wavefront / Strehl at nominal and best composite focus
WAV
NOM Y
GO
! per-field weights and focus groups
WAV
WTF 1 0 0
GO
WAV
CPL 1 2 2
NRD 16
GO
! RFO refuses a solved image distance
WAV
RFO Y
GO
! without the PIM solve RFO refocuses; NOM afterwards ~ the BES values
DEL PIM
WAV
RFO Y
GO
WAV
NOM Y
BES N
GO
! bad input
WAV
NRD 2
NOM MAYBE
WTF 1 x
CPL 0
CAN
WAV 3
